                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice & simple, and the type of thing that made my parents think of Space Invaders. It's not a complex game - one button to do anything - so they picked it up really easily. Had them freaking out over the giant UFOs wiping out the city which is always fun to see! =D \n\nThe game is currently a little light on content, but I'm assuming that's going to change as more time passes because it's early access -- keen to see what they add next!!",
